# Runtime data directory.
#
# At runtime the delivery layer writes:
#   data/opt_out.jsonl   - persistent opt-out list (one JSON per line)
#   data/send_log.jsonl  - audit log of every delivery attempt
#
# These files are .gitignored. This .gitkeep exists so the directory ships
# in the repo and the safety guards have somewhere to write on first run.
